# Water RASSCF, ORCA 6.1.1 section 3.13.3.7.
# Four active electrons in four orbitals. RAS1 permits one hole and
# RAS3 permits one particle. RAS2 has unrestricted occupations.
! def2-SVP TightSCF SP
%casscf
  nel 4
  norb 4
  mult 1
  nroots 1
  refs
    RAS(4: 1 1 / 2 / 1 1)
  end
end
* xyz 0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.758602   0.000000   0.586541
H  -0.758602   0.000000   0.586541
*
